Inside an unclosed fence only the innermost container's closer is structural

````
::: outer
:::: inner
```
code
:::
::::
:::
after *b*
.
<div class="outer">
  <div class="inner">
    <pre><code>code
:::
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<p>after <strong>b</strong></p>
````

